      "writtenOn": "2025-11-25T09:56:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is probably for the legacy GKI 1.0 testing, where we lookup AVB footer from the end of the partition. We copied those numbers from AOSP `gki_arm64` builds (b/222078981#comment2)\n\nSince `avbtool` later supports `--dynamic_partition_size`\nhttps://android-review.googlesource.com/c/platform/external/avb/+/1988815\n\nPerhaps we can use `--dynamic_partition_size` to replace `--partition_size 33554432` here. (This can be a separate CL).\n\n@yochiang@google.com\n@bettyzhou@google.com\n@howardsoc@google.com for more eyes (e.g., from testing POV).",
